The guy with the pulleys pulled the rope, shut the doors.

1351
00:58:12.070 --> 00:58:18.010
And then we relocated to a completely different building to the Dunder Mifflin elevator.

1352
00:58:18.010 --> 00:58:20.850
And we got out, and it is seamless.

1353
00:58:20.850 --> 00:58:22.510
It looks so good.

1354
00:58:22.850 --> 00:58:24.530
Ugh, that was funny.

1355
00:58:24.990 --> 00:58:32.250
And then we walk in, and Michael has his line that I have seen quoted so many times, where

1356
00:58:32.250 --> 00:58:37.730
he says, well, well, well, how the turntables.

1357
00:58:39.570 --> 00:58:42.730
Okay, I had to know how that was scripted.

1358
