1364
00:59:00.850 --> 00:59:04.310
Well, well, well, oh, how the meteors fallen.

1365
00:59:04.970 --> 00:59:05.330
Hmm.

1366
00:59:05.990 --> 00:59:08.450
And I love the turntables so much better.

1367
00:59:09.890 --> 00:59:11.370
Turntables is so funny.

1368
00:59:11.370 --> 00:59:14.970
I know, because Michael gets all of his phrases slightly off.

1369
00:59:15.070 --> 00:59:15.890
And Michael, you know what?

1370
00:59:15.970 --> 00:59:17.090
I can relate to that.

1371
00:59:18.170 --> 00:59:19.330
And you still sell-

1372
