00:59:39.610 --> 00:59:44.650
Kelly and Angela are trying to eavesdrop, and Kelly has her ear to the door with like

1381
00:59:44.650 --> 00:59:45.670
a coffee mug.

1382
00:59:46.430 --> 00:59:47.370
Mindy and I kept laughing.

1383
00:59:47.610 --> 00:59:48.690
That was so funny.

1384
00:59:48.870 --> 00:59:50.410
It was so ridiculous.

1385
